    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CHUNG-SOOK: Shit!\nKI-JUNG: I told you to close it!\nCHUNG-SOOK: Fuck me.",
      "PIZZA SHOP OWNER: Look at this for example. This shitty folding job here.\nPIZZA SHOP OWNER: One out of four. One-fourth of the boxes are unusable.\nCHUNG-SOOK: Still, you can’t cut ten percent from my pay. That’s too much.\nPIZZA SHOP OWNER: I should pay even less considering the number of botched boxes.",
